      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1059269201,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Adding a static SharkFest link looks OK to me. Other options include\n\n* Adding the link at the top of the welcome page. We have room for a small banner on the right side opposite \"Welcome to Wireshark\".\n\n* Pulling the text and link dynamically, e.g. via a QNetworkRequest to wireshark.org.\n\nI'm leaning toward both options, since it would let us provide timely information in general.",
